.nh
.TH "GUMROAD" "1" "Sep 2026" "Gumroad" "Gumroad CLI"

.SH NAME
gumroad-products-comps - See what similar products charge


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgumroad products comps [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Report the price distribution of comparable priced public products on Gumroad, so a new product can be priced against real marketplace numbers. Categories include their descendants, and free listings are excluded. Find category paths with gumroad products categories.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--category\fP=""
	Category path, descendants included (see: gumroad products categories)

.PP
\fB--currency\fP=""
	Currency to compare in (ISO code, default usd)

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for comps

.PP
\fB--query\fP=""
	Full-text filter over product names and descriptions


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	Enable debug logging to stderr

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	Preview mutating requests without executing them

.PP
\fB--jq\fP=""
	Filter JSON output with a jq expression

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Output as JSON

.PP
\fB--no-color\fP[=false]
	Disable color output

.PP
\fB--no-image\fP[=false]
	Disable image rendering

.PP
\fB--no-input\fP[=false]
	Disable interactive prompts

.PP
\fB--non-interactive\fP[=false]
	Run in explicit CI/agent mode

.PP
\fB--page-delay\fP=0s
	Wait between paginated --all requests (e.g. 200ms, 1s)

.PP
\fB--plain\fP[=false]
	Output as plain tab-separated text

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	Suppress non-essential output

.PP
\fB--yes\fP[=false]
	Skip confirmation prompts


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  gumroad products comps --category design/ui-and-web/figma
  gumroad products comps --category music-and-sound-design --query "whoosh sfx"
  gumroad products comps --query "notion template" --json --jq '.comps.price_cents'
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBgumroad-products(1)\fP
